# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The WebGL aquarium's speed (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.aquarium): the home screen unlocked, the page opened through SpringBoard
# and left 90 s; src/cputop.c beside it says which processes take the cores meanwhile (WebKit's content process, its
# GPU process, the window server). With metal_stats=1 the plug-in says each command buffer's passes and draws.
/redwood/bin/cputop 5 &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 20
/redwood/bin/battery_test open https://webglsamples.org/aquarium/aquarium.html
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 90 button home wait 3
